# Dantooine, the battle of Khoonda and away (TSL, 602DAN, 601DAN, 003EBO):
# Khoonda's defences readied for Zherron (Suulru, Akkere, Dillan and
# Jorran recruited; the assault droids reactivated, Akkere's parts bought
# for them, the wounded militia treated by hand ([Treat Injury]), Akkere's
# hydrospanner found and his story believed (500 credits given, LSP),
# Khoonda's side door sealed; left: the medic droid (four parts Dxun's
# droids need), the turret and droid consoles (slicing and reprogramming
# ask a dozen computer spikes the Dantooine stores no longer hold) and the
# mines (no harness goal recovers or lays one)), the battle plans finalised,
# Azkul in Khoonda's hall told he can still back away, Vrook come to fight
# beside the Exile, the mercenaries fought, the Administrator's reward
# left to rebuild Khoonda (LSP), Vrook's word after the battle (asked
# through) and his form taught, and back aboard the Ebon Hawk (no Visas
# Marr there yet: her ambush follows the Ravager's scene, not seen).
# Starts from the attack's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dantooine_attack data/routes/tsl/dantooine_battle.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "The Mercenary Attack" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
